# ── MARK LIII — what never belongs in the repository ──────────────────────────
# Everything listed here is created by the app on first run. A fresh clone with
# none of it present boots straight to the setup screen, which is the intended
# first experience — so nothing here needs to be committed, and some of it must
# never be.

# ── Secrets. Committing any of these publishes them. ──────────────────────────
# Gemini API key and per-plugin credentials
config/api_keys.json
# Dashboard TLS private key and certificate
config/certs/
# Linked WhatsApp session
config/whatsapp_web/
# Google OAuth tokens (Gmail / Calendar plugins)
**/token*.json
**/client_secret*.json
*credentials*.json
.env
.env.*

# ── Personal data the assistant accumulates about you ─────────────────────────
memory/long_term.json
memory/user_persona.json
memory/reflections.json
memory/*.db

# ── Large Neural Models & Voice Weights ────────────────────────────────────────
*.onnx
*.tflite
*.bin
*.pt
*.pth
core/models/piper/*
!core/models/piper/.gitkeep

# ── Generated SFX & Audio Cache ───────────────────────────────────────────────
core/assets/sfx/*.wav
*.mp3
*.wav
!core/assets/sfx/.gitkeep

# ── Python build noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# ── Virtual environments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ── Editors and operating systems ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Runtime output & Temporary Files ──────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
logs/
downloads/
screenshots/
scratch/
